      "source": "Derived by OriginalWeaponBuilder from ITM/Rogue_mp.itm row 98 (id 1038, 'SpecialEffects'): f[36] energy cost 0, f[54] fireDelay 25 (10 ms units), f[172] drain 250000, f[160] hull damage 5000; energy amounts in thousandths (OriginalEnergyScale).",
      "newValues": [
        "Muzzle velocity 1272.727 px/s = raw 4000 x 700/2200 (Plasma Cannon scale; unit open, G10 W2).",
        "Lifetime 2.5 s = raw 550 x 2.5/550 (Plasma Cannon scale; unit open, G10 W3).",
        "Radius 3 = raw proximity 4 x 3/4 (Plasma Cannon scale; meaning open).",
        "A shot does not inherit the satellite's velocity (it does not move) and costs it no energy (the emulator's turret never pays). It stops on walls and asteroids; its BounceCount is not applied.",
        "Hull damage ignores the damage type and armour (RT-F041)."
